abstract: >-
  Working R scripts, processed occupational data, source-audit notes and
  illustrative figures for descriptive U.S. metropolitan OEWS 2021-2025
  comparisons alongside separately bounded saved synthetic AI benchmark
  evidence. This archive does not establish AI causality or full occupational
  task validation. A Zenodo DOI has not yet been assigned.
